          "text": "UThera wathatha u-Abrama indodana yakhe, noLoti, indodana kaHarana, indodana yendodana yakhe, noSarayi umalokazana wakhe, umka-Abrama indodana yakhe; basuka kanye nabo e-Uri lamaKaledi ukuya ezweni laseKhanani; bafika eHarana, bahlala khona.",
